{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544120/extras/163215a32dafe332cf5d30b59b64db7c.avif?t=1743090931\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rollover \u2013 The Ultimate Test of Patience and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rollover is a brutally punishing climbing game</strong> <strong>where every roll could be your last.</strong> With unpredictable, difficult physics and a movement system designed to test your limits, you'll battle your way upward\u2014one agonizing moment at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every misstep sends you tumbling down, erasing hours of progress in seconds.</strong> The higher you climb, the more the pressure mounts, and the more your sanity unravels. This game isn\u2019t just about reaching the top\u2014it\u2019s about enduring the journey, overcoming frustration, and proving to yourself that you can master the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to roll, or will you lose your sanity before the game does?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544120/extras/3cd42394708411de5c162a931fd5856c.avif?t=1743090931\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficult \u2013 Prepare for a real challenge!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try to get the fastest time</strong> <strong>\u2013</strong> <strong>Only the quickest will conquer!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smash spacebar to utilize movement</strong> <strong>\u2013 The faster you hit, the better you move!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the controls</strong> <strong>\u2013 Precision is key to success!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544120?t=1743090931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544120?t=1743090931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544120/6d72ad387743e32c2a86da1eaf0a6694ed6a010a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743090931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544120/6d72ad387743e32c2a86da1eaf0a6694ed6a010a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743090931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544120/extras/163215a32dafe332cf5d30b59b64db7c.avif?t=1743090931\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rollover \u2013 The Ultimate Test of Patience and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rollover is a brutally punishing climbing game</strong> <strong>where every roll could be your last.</strong> With unpredictable, difficult physics and a movement system designed to test your limits, you'll battle your way upward\u2014one agonizing moment at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every misstep sends you tumbling down, erasing hours of progress in seconds.</strong> The higher you climb, the more the pressure mounts, and the more your sanity unravels. This game isn\u2019t just about reaching the top\u2014it\u2019s about enduring the journey, overcoming frustration, and proving to yourself that you can master the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A